Deep Space Command Bridge is an independent DeepSeek Harness theme.
It is not an official DeepSeek, NASA, ESA, CSA or STScI product.

The package structure and integration seams were inspected in the locally
installed dsh-theme-plugin and maid-atelier packages. Their application code
and artwork have not been overwritten or bundled into this theme.

The galaxy and nebula photographs are credited in assets/resource/CREDIT.md.
They are not licensed under this project's MIT software license. The source
usage terms remain applicable. The cockpit frame is AI-generated artwork.
The default panorama is an AI-assisted artistic composite of credited M83,
Westerlund 2 and Webb Cosmic Cliffs observations. It is not a scientific sky map.
The titanium wall texture is also AI-generated. One continuous panorama is shared by three window apertures;
procedural stars and warp trails are separate decorative effects.
The three independently dockable working screens are live UI, not artwork.
